      "displayName": "Ben Pennell",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I've put together a tool to automate locating and fixing the names of resources in pairtrees with same name siblings. Its not perfect, for instance it will create a basic container instead of a pairtree in some situations since I was unable to create empty pairtrees:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/UNC-Libraries/fedora-repair-siblings\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/UNC-Libraries/fedora-repair-siblings</a></p>",
     "created": "30/Jun/20 4:55 PM",
     "id": "21300",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/13250/comment/21300",
